<title>USA: Cidco names Kent chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Cidco names Kent chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>MORGAN HILL, Calif. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>CIDCO Inc on Monday said Richard Kent, vice president and corporate controller, was named chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>He replaces Scott McDonald, who joined the company's board of directors and resigned as executive vice president, chief operating officer and chief financial officer.</p>
</text>
